    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "\ud83d\ude97 Gear up for mayhem in this arcadey couch competitive car combat game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuckle up and dive into the adrenaline-fueled world of vehicular chaos with thisaction-packed car combat game. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf10 Multiple Arenas Await!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose your battleground from a variety of arenas, each with its own unique challenges and tactical opportunities. From the suburbs to warehouses, every setting is a canvas for vehicular destruction.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83e\udd16 Challenge Friends or Go Solo!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGather up to 4 friends on the couch for split-screen mayhem, or go solo and take on AI opponents in a challenging single-player mode. The competition is fierce, but victory is sweeter when earned against your friends!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udc4a Easy to Learn, Hard to Master!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAccessible controls make it easy for newcomers to jump in, but mastering the art of vehicular warfare will separate the rookies from the champions. Take advantage of the skies strategically\u2014temporarily fly to flee danger, gain a tactical advantage, or rain chaos from above! Are you ready to claim the title of the ultimate road warrior? <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfae Couch Competitive Madness Awaits!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGrab your controllers, rev your engines, and get ready for a car combat experience like no other. Drive, shoot, and outmaneuver your way to victory in our adrenaline-pumping, couch competitive car combat game. The road to glory starts here!",
    "about_the_game": "\ud83d\ude97 Gear up for mayhem in this arcadey couch competitive car combat game!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBuckle up and dive into the adrenaline-fueled world of vehicular chaos with thisaction-packed car combat game. <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udf10 Multiple Arenas Await!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChoose your battleground from a variety of arenas, each with its own unique challenges and tactical opportunities. From the suburbs to warehouses, every setting is a canvas for vehicular destruction.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83e\udd16 Challenge Friends or Go Solo!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGather up to 4 friends on the couch for split-screen mayhem, or go solo and take on AI opponents in a challenging single-player mode. The competition is fierce, but victory is sweeter when earned against your friends!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83d\udc4a Easy to Learn, Hard to Master!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAccessible controls make it easy for newcomers to jump in, but mastering the art of vehicular warfare will separate the rookies from the champions. Take advantage of the skies strategically\u2014temporarily fly to flee danger, gain a tactical advantage, or rain chaos from above! Are you ready to claim the title of the ultimate road warrior? <br />\r\n<br />\r\n\ud83c\udfae Couch Competitive Madness Awaits!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGrab your controllers, rev your engines, and get ready for a car combat experience like no other. Drive, shoot, and outmaneuver your way to victory in our adrenaline-pumping, couch competitive car combat game. The road to glory starts here!",
    "short_description": "Gear up for intense couch competitive car combat! Customize your ride, equip temporary flight, and dominate dynamic arenas. Gather up to 4 friends locally or go solo in thrilling game modes. Drive, shoot, fly and outmaneuver your way to victory in this adrenaline-pumping experience!",
